        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Cabergoline tablets is not recommended in postpartum women who are breastfeeding or who are planning to breastfeed.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-cabergoline",
